<title>UK: UBS prices $250 million bond for Citibank CCMT.</title>
<headline>UBS prices $250 million bond for Citibank CCMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, lead manager UBS Ltd said on Thursday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITIBANK CREDIT CARD MASTER TRUST 1</p>
<p> AMT	  $250 MLN  COUPON     6.25	LEGAL MAT  *10.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.648    PAY DATE    10.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.1875    REOFFER    99.648    SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    GOV LAW     N.Y</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.0625    SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *EXPECTED MATURITY IS 10.FEB.00.</p>
<p>		THERE ARE ALSO $16 MLN CLASS B FRNS RATED A2/A</p>
<p>		UNDERWRITTEN AND MANAGED BY MERRILL LYNCH</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
